'''Dragon (Classic)''' was a {{Mythical}} [[Beast]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that used to cost {{Money|3,500,000}} or {{Robux|2,600}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Dragon was an incredible fruit for [[PVP mechanics|PvP]] due to its powerful AoE and [[Instinct Break]] moves. This fruit was recommended for air campers because it did high damage to them. This Blox Fruit was used to counter awakened [[Dough#Moveset (V2)|Dough]], [[Ice]], and other fruits due to its long-ranged attacks in the air. 

Dragon (Classic) had a transformed mode that enhanced its attacks, similar to awakened [[Phoenix#Moveset (V2)|Phoenix]].

