==Trivia==
* If the player attempted to purchase Dragon (Classic) from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]] or [[Shop]] during [[Update 23]], they would get the message: "<font color= "#ffe533">'''The king of fruits is temporarily off sale for enhancements.'''</font> '''Stay tuned for its powerful return!'''", instead of the normal Robux purchase screen.
* Before [[Update 24]], Dragon (Classic) was the third most expensive fruit in the game. But, from [[Update 13|Updates 13]]-[[Update 17.2|17.2]], it was the most expensive.
* After [[Update 24]], people who ate Dragon (Classic) before the update still had it in their inventory. However, after the developers fixed the bug, the players who ate the Dragon (Classic) got either Eastern or Western Dragon.
* Dragon (Classic) had the biggest transformed model in the game.
* '''[C] Fire Shower''' was similar to [[Light#Moveset (V1)|Light's Unawakened]] '''[X] Barrage of Light'''.
* In addition to the colors above, there was a pink color in game exclusive to admins.
* The transformed dragon was an Eastern mythological dragon.

